---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = "August 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy and data protection practices for Travelling Senior. Learn how we collect, use, and safeguard your email address for our newsletter and marketing communications."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-16 space-y-10">
    
    <!-- Page Header -->
    <header class="relative rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-navy-950 via-slate-900 to-navy-900 text-white border border-white/10 shadow-xl space-y-4">
      <div class="absolute right-0 top-0 w-80 h-80 bg-brand-500/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      
      <div class="relative z-10 space-y-3">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-400 border border-brand-500/30">
          Transparency & Trust
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          At Travelling Senior, your privacy and trust are paramount. This policy clearly explains how we collect, use, and protect your information, including your email address for marketing purposes.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 pt-2 border-t border-white/10">
          Last updated: {lastUpdated}
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Privacy Content Container -->
    <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 space-y-10 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-base">

      <!-- 1. Overview & Commitment -->
      <section class="space-y-3 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          1. Our Commitment to Your Privacy
        </h2>
        <p>
          <strong>Travelling Senior</strong> ("we," "our," or "us") is dedicated to providing high-quality travel guides, senior lifestyle advice, and vacation inspiration for mature explorers. We respect your right to privacy and are committed to complying with applicable data privacy laws, including the <em>Australian Privacy Principles (APPs)</em> under the <em>Privacy Act 1988 (Cth)</em>, the <em>Spam Act 2003 (Cth)</em>, and international privacy standards.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third-party data brokers or advertisers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 2. What Information We Collect -->
      <section class="space-y-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          2. Information We Collect
        </h2>
        <p>
          We only collect personal information that is reasonably necessary for our editorial and communication activities:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>
            <strong>Email Address & Contact Information:</strong> When you subscribe to our <em>Weekly Travel Digest</em>, enter your email into our newsletter forms, or contact our editorial desk with a story pitch or inquiry.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Subscriber Preferences:</strong> Information regarding the emails you open or click, helping us provide relevant travel destinations and senior discounts.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Technical & Browsing Data:</strong> Non-personally identifiable information such as browser type, device type, operating system, IP address, general geographic location, and pages viewed. This data helps us ensure our website is fast, secure, and accessible on all devices.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- 3. Marketing & Email Communications -->
      <section class="space-y-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">
          <span>📧</span>
          <span>Direct Marketing Notice</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          3. How We Use Your Email for Marketing Purposes
        </h2>
        <p>
          When you submit your email address through our subscription form, you consent to receive direct marketing communications from Travelling Senior. These communications include:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700/60 space-y-1">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm">📬 Weekly Travel Digest</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Curated weekly destination spotlights, accessible itinerary blueprints, and senior travel guides delivered every Thursday.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700/60 space-y-1">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm">🏷️ Exclusive Senior Deals</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Hand-picked senior rail pass promotions, seasonal cruise discounts, and winter sun accommodation savings.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700/60 space-y-1">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm">💡 Tips & Insurance Guides</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Practical advice on pre-existing medical coverage, luggage handling, travel safety, and mobility assistance.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700/60 space-y-1">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm">📰 Editorial Announcements</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Special seasonal issues, reader community stories, and website feature updates.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm">
          We only send marketing messages where you have voluntarily opted in or where permitted by law. We adhere strictly to the Australian <em>Spam Act 2003</em> and the US <em>CAN-SPAM Act</em>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 4. Third-Party Service Providers (Mailchimp) -->
      <section class="space-y-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          4. Third-Party Email Service (Mailchimp)
        </h2>
        <p>
          We partner with <strong>Intuit Mailchimp</strong> to securely store subscriber email lists, manage subscriber preferences, and send our email dispatches.
        </p>
        <p>
          When you subscribe, your email address is transferred to and processed by Mailchimp in accordance with their <a href="https://www.intuit.com/privacy/statement/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 underline font-semibold">Global Privacy Statement</a> and security safeguards. Mailchimp employs industry-standard encryption, bot detection, and access controls to keep your email safe.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 5. 1-Click Unsubscribe & Opting Out -->
      <section class="space-y-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          5. 1-Click Unsubscribe & Opt-Out Guarantee
        </h2>
        <p>
          You are always in control of your subscription. You can opt out of receiving our marketing emails at any time:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>
            <strong>Instant Unsubscribe:</strong> Every email we send contains a prominent, one-click <strong>"Unsubscribe"</strong> link in the footer.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Email Request:</strong> You may also contact us directly at any time to request removal from our database.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-sm">
          Once you unsubscribe, your email will be promptly removed from our active marketing lists and you will receive no further weekly digests unless you choose to re-subscribe.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 6. Cookies & Web Technologies -->
      <section class="space-y-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          6. Cookies and Local Storage
        </h2>
        <p>
          Our website uses minimal, non-intrusive cookies and browser local storage:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Display Preferences:</strong> To remember your visual preferences, such as Dark Mode or Light Mode theme selection.</li>
          <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Anonymous aggregate statistics to understand which travel articles and categories our readers find most helpful.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-sm">
          You can disable cookies in your web browser settings at any time without losing access to the articles on this website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 7. Data Security & Storage -->
      <section class="space-y-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          7. Data Security and Retention
        </h2>
        <p>
          We implement technical and organizational measures to safeguard your personal data against unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction. We use secure HTTPS encryption across the entirety of our website.
        </p>
        <p>
          We retain your email address only for as long as your subscription is active, or as required by applicable legal obligations.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 8. Your Rights -->
      <section class="space-y-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          8. Your Privacy Rights
        </h2>
        <p>
          Depending on your location, you have rights regarding your personal information, including:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Access:</strong> Requesting confirmation of whether we hold your personal details and obtaining a copy.</li>
          <li><strong>Correction:</strong> Requesting corrections to inaccurate or out-of-date information.</li>
          <li><strong>Erasure:</strong> Requesting complete deletion of your email address and records.</li>
          <li><strong>Withdraw Consent:</strong> Withdrawing marketing consent at any time.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- 9. Contact Us -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          9. Contact Our Editorial & Privacy Team
        </h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, our data collection practices, or wish to exercise your privacy rights, please get in touch with us:
        </p>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-brand-500/10 border border-brand-500/20 space-y-2 text-sm">
          <p class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Travelling Senior Journal</p>
          <p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="/" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 hover:underline">travellingsenior.example.com</a></p>
          <p><strong>Privacy Inquiries:</strong> <a href="mailto:privacy@travellingsenior.com" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 hover:underline font-semibold">privacy@travellingsenior.com</a></p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 pt-1">
            We review and respond to all privacy-related inquiries within 5 business days.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>

    <!-- Back to Home Link -->
    <div class="text-center pt-4">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-amber-500 hover:from-brand-500 hover:to-amber-400 shadow-md shadow-brand-500/25 transition-all"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18" />
        </svg>
        <span>Back to Homepage</span>
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
